# One line ending everywhere: the repository stores LF so a clone on any
# platform gets the same bytes. Both halves are loaded as source by the shell —
# the browser half is fetched as an artifact and its cache revision is derived
# from the file's mtime, ctime and size — so byte-stable checkouts keep the
# plugin's own tests (which assert the Chinese strings are intact) honest.
* text=auto eol=lf
